Author: {{author}}
PR: #{{prNumber}}
Environment: {{environment}}

AI Risk Assessment: {{riskLevel}}
Risk Factors: {{riskFactors}}
Recommendation: {{recommendation}}

Approve or reject this deployment.

Deployment {{#if deploySuccess}}Succeeded{{else}}Failed{{/if}}

Repo: {{repo}} ({{branch}})
Commit: {{commitSha}}
Environment: {{environment}}
Author: {{author}}
Approved by: {{approvedBy}}
Risk Level: {{riskLevel}}

{{#if deploySuccess}}Health check: PASSING
Deployment completed successfully.{{else}}Health check: {{healthStatus}}
Please investigate immediately. Rollback may be required.
